 "explanation": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "two lazy-deletion heaps: a min-heap holding the k largest (value, index) entries of the window and a max-heap with the rest; a location array marks which heap owns each live index and running sums give each average in O(1). Complexity target: O(n log n) time/O(n) space.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
